'''Night Beach Lilin''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] and is an anti-[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 666
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Night Beach Lilin
|name2 = Night Beach Lilin, type π
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Night Beach Lilin, type π''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Night Beach Lilin is a midranger who, along with barrier breaker and warp immunity to better deal with Starred Aliens, targets Traitless and Aliens. Her survivability falls between below average and average and her dodge chance can be seen as nothing more than an occasional bonus given its horrendous activation chance. Lilin will occasionally die rather quickly in mixed trait stages. Night Beach Lilin's offensive abilities are also mediocre. Even considering these facts, anti-Traitless units are hard to come by and as such one may find use in her if they don't have any better anti-Traitless or EPICFEST exclusives. Using her against Aliens can be a painful experience, especially in late-game, given that Aliens are backliner-heavy and may target Lilin in between meatshield position shifts, made worse by Night Beach Lilin only being able to reposition twice.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & Breaker}}

